# Procedural star glare, diffraction spikes, and optical lens flare (Enhanced Graphics)

Shader lens_flare

PushConstant vec4 starParams
PushConstant vec4 starColor
PushConstant vec4 flareParams

Buffer DrawData binding=1

Vertex "lens_flare.vert"
Fragment "lens_flare.frag"
